---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import SiteHead from '../../components/SiteHead.astro';
import '../../styles/site.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<title>About Sampada VR Speciality Eye Care | Retina Hospital in Tirur, Kerala</title>
		<meta name="description" content="About Sampada VR Speciality Eye Care on Railway Station Bypass Road, Tirur: the clinic story, Dr. Sameera V V's vitreoretinal credentials, OCT, Humphrey Field Analyzer, fundus camera and green laser, and our mission, vision and patient promise.">
<meta name="robots" content="max-image-preview:large">
	<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://sampadavr.com/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "About Us",
      "item": "https://sampadavr.com/about/"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://sampadavr.com/about/">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"><SiteHead />
</head>
<body>
			<Header />
			<main class="svr-page" id="main">

				<section class="svr-hero">
					<div class="svr-wrap">
						<p class="svr-crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; About Us</p>
						<h1>The retina specialists of Tirur, in a clinic designed around you</h1>
						<p class="svr-lead">Sampada VR Speciality Eye Care is the first centre in the Malabar region dedicated to vitreoretinal disease, on Railway Station Bypass Road, Thazhepalam, a few minutes from Tirur railway station.</p>
						<div class="svr-hero__actions">
							<a class="svr-btn svr-btn--primary" href="tel:+919188572412">Book Appointment</a>
							<a class="svr-btn svr-btn--ghost" href="#about-surgeon">Meet Dr. Sameera</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<div class="svr-wrap">
					<div class="svr-facts" role="list">
						<div class="svr-fact" role="listitem"><strong>Dec 2020</strong><span>Opened in Tirur</span></div>
						<div class="svr-fact" role="listitem"><strong>14 years</strong><span>Vitreoretinal surgical experience</span></div>
						<div class="svr-fact" role="listitem"><strong>4.7 &#9733;</strong><span>From 2,200+ Google reviews</span></div>
						<div class="svr-fact" role="listitem"><strong>Mon&ndash;Sat</strong><span>Open six days a week</span></div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Clinic story -->
				<section class="svr-sec" aria-labelledby="about-story">
					<div class="svr-wrap svr-split">
						<div>
							<span class="svr-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
							<h2 class="svr-h2" id="about-story">A boutique retina centre on the Tirur Railway Station Bypass Road</h2>
							<p>Sampada VR sits on Railway Station Bypass Road in Thazhepalam, a few minutes from Tirur railway station and the bus stand. It opened in December 2020 to give the Malabar region something it did not have: a centre focused entirely on diseases of the retina and vitreous, so that patients no longer had to travel to a distant city for a specialist opinion.</p>
							<p>Patients come to us from Tirur, Tanur, Kottakkal, Valanchery and Parappanangadi, and from further afield in Kozhikode, Wayanad, Palakkad and Thrissur. The centre is a boutique consultation and surgery space, designed for comfort, with particular care for elderly patients and premature babies, who have the most to gain from an unhurried, gentle setting.</p>
							<p>The name carries the idea. &ldquo;Sampada&rdquo; is heritage and wealth; &ldquo;VR&rdquo; stands for vitreoretina and for the virtual-reality and AI tools we are exploring for screening. Our logo is drawn from the three zones of the retina used in retinopathy of prematurity screening.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="svr-split__media">
							<img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sampadavr-reception.webp" alt="Reception desk at Sampada VR Speciality Eye Care, Tirur" width="1024" height="682" loading="lazy">
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- Surgeon -->
				<section class="svr-sec svr-sec--mist" id="about-surgeon" aria-labelledby="about-surgeon-h">
					<div class="svr-wrap svr-split svr-split--rev">
						<div class="svr-split__media">
							<img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/dr-sameera-sampada-1024x682.webp" alt="Dr. Sameera V V, vitreoretinal surgeon at Sampada VR" width="1024" height="682" loading="lazy">
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="svr-eyebrow">Vitreoretinal Surgery Expertise</span>
							<h2 class="svr-h2" id="about-surgeon-h">Dr. Sameera V V, Medical Director and retina surgeon</h2>
							<p>Dr. Sameera leads every retinal case at Sampada VR, from diabetic retinopathy and retinal detachment to macular disease and retinopathy of prematurity. Her training and career span some of India&rsquo;s best-known retina and eye institutes.</p>
							<ul class="svr-cred">
								<li><strong>Qualifications:</strong> MBBS, followed by specialisation in Ophthalmology at Calicut Medical College.</li>
								<li><strong>Fellowships:</strong> long-term fellowships in Vitreoretinal Surgery and Anterior Segment Surgery at MM Joshi Eye Institute and AFEH, Palakkad; specialised retinal laser training at Aravind Eye Hospital, Madurai.</li>
								<li><strong>Experience:</strong> Consultant Phaco and Retina Surgeon at MM Joshi Eye Institute, Hubli, and Maxivision Eye Hospital, Hyderabad; head of the Vitreo Retinal Department across three Rayhan Eye Hospital branches in Kerala.</li>
								<li><strong>Research:</strong> co-investigator in the Phase 3 trial of Biosimilar Ranibizumab in India, and an early Indian adopter of micropulse laser for macular disease.</li>
								<li><strong>Memberships:</strong> Indian Medical Association and Vitreo Retinal Society of India (life member); Asia Pacific Academy of Ophthalmology.</li>
							</ul>
							<p style="margin-top:22px"><a class="svr-btn svr-btn--outline" href="/about-dr-sameera-v-v/">Read her full profile</a></p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- Equipment -->
				<section class="svr-sec" aria-labelledby="about-equip">
					<div class="svr-wrap">
						<div class="svr-sechead">
							<span class="svr-eyebrow">Diagnostic Technology</span>
							<h2 class="svr-h2" id="about-equip">The right equipment, in the same building</h2>
							<p class="svr-lead">Most retinal decisions depend on imaging. We keep the key instruments in-house so a scan, a test and a treatment plan can happen in a single visit.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="svr-grid svr-grid--4">
							<article class="svr-card">
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Retinal imaging</span>
								<h3>OCT</h3>
								<p>Optical Coherence Tomography, on a Topcon 3D Maestro2 combined OCT and fundus camera, images the retina layer by layer in seconds.</p>
								<a class="svr-more" href="/treatments/oct-scan/">About OCT scans &rarr;</a>
							</article>
							<article class="svr-card">
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Visual fields</span>
								<h3>Humphrey Field Analyzer</h3>
								<p>The gold standard for visual field testing, used to detect glaucoma and track it over the years.</p>
								<a class="svr-more" href="/blog/humphrey-field-analyzer-glaucoma-detection/">How it works &rarr;</a>
							</article>
							<article class="svr-card">
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Retinal photography</span>
								<h3>Fundus Camera</h3>
								<p>High-resolution photographs of the back of the eye, used for diabetic retinopathy screening and to document change between visits.</p>
								<a class="svr-more" href="/blog/diabetic-retinopathy-retinal-imaging/">Retinal imaging &rarr;</a>
							</article>
							<article class="svr-card">
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Retinal laser</span>
								<h3>Green Laser</h3>
								<p>Precision retinal laser for diabetic retinopathy and to seal retinal tears, a minimally invasive treatment with a quick recovery.</p>
								<a class="svr-more" href="/treatments/diabetic-retinopathy-treatment/">Laser treatment &rarr;</a>
							</article>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- Why Sampada VR (merged from the old /why-sampada-vr/ page) -->
				<section class="svr-sec svr-sec--cream" aria-labelledby="about-why">
					<div class="svr-wrap">
						<div class="svr-sechead svr-sechead--center">
							<span class="svr-eyebrow">Why Choose Us</span>
							<h2 class="svr-h2" id="about-why">Why patients choose Sampada VR</h2>
						</div>
						<div class="svr-grid svr-grid--3">
							<article class="svr-card"><h3>Unhurried examinations</h3><p>Every patient receives our undivided attention, with examinations that are thorough and detailed so nothing is overlooked.</p></article>
							<article class="svr-card"><h3>Boutique consultation and surgery</h3><p>A centre designed for comfort and personal care, so every visit feels calm rather than crowded.</p></article>
							<article class="svr-card"><h3>Advanced retinal care</h3><p>World-class imaging and treatment technology for retinal diagnosis and care, available locally in Tirur.</p></article>
							<article class="svr-card"><h3>Specialist expertise</h3><p>A retina surgeon with a long record of surgical experience, leading your care personally.</p></article>
							<article class="svr-card"><h3>Tele-consultation network</h3><p>We connect with national and international specialists for related conditions linked to retinal health.</p></article>
							<article class="svr-card"><h3>Dedicated care team</h3><p>Optometrists, orthoptists, patient care executives and surgical nurses who support you at every step.</p></article>
						</div>
						<div class="svr-split" style="margin-top:56px">
							<div>
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Research and Innovation</span>
								<h3 class="svr-h2" style="font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,34px)">A clinic that keeps learning, and a team that cares</h3>
								<p>As a research-minded clinic we are exploring new ways to bring retinal screening to more people, from instruments for mass screening of retinal disease to virtual reality in ophthalmology.</p>
								<p>None of it works without people. Our optometrists, orthoptists, patient care executives and surgical nurses are the team you meet at every step of your visit.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="svr-split__media">
								<img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sampadavr-team.webp" alt="The Sampada VR care team in Tirur" width="1024" height="682" loading="lazy">
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- Mission, Vision, Patient Promise -->
				<section class="svr-sec svr-sec--navy" aria-labelledby="about-mvp">
					<div class="svr-wrap">
						<div class="svr-sechead svr-sechead--center">
							<span class="svr-eyebrow">What Guides Us</span>
							<h2 class="svr-h2" id="about-mvp">Mission, Vision and Patient Promise</h2>
						</div>
						<div class="svr-mvp">
							<article class="svr-mvp__card">
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Mission</span>
								<h3>Advanced retinal technology, delivered with compassion</h3>
								<p>To pair advanced retinal technology with personalised, compassionate care, and to make treatment for retinal disease reachable for patients across Tirur and Malappuram district.</p>
							</article>
							<article class="svr-mvp__card">
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Vision</span>
								<h3>A Malabar where sight is not lost to a preventable disease</h3>
								<p>A Malabar region where nobody loses sight to a disease that could have been caught in time, with the expertise of a multispecialty eye hospital and the personal touch of a clinic.</p>
							</article>
							<article class="svr-mvp__card">
								<span class="svr-eyebrow">Patient Promise</span>
								<h3>Seen by a specialist. Told the truth.</h3>
								<p>Every patient is seen by a specialist, examined with the right equipment, and told plainly what is happening to their eyes and what can be done about it.</p>
							</article>
						</div>
						<div class="svr-values" aria-label="Our values"><span>Compassionate Innovation</span><span>Empowered Healing</span><span>A Brighter Horizon</span></div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<!-- Visit us -->
				<section class="svr-sec" aria-labelledby="about-visit">
					<div class="svr-wrap">
						<div class="svr-ctaband">
							<div>
								<h2 id="about-visit">Visit us in Tirur</h2>
								<p>Book a retina consultation or a complete eye check-up. Call our team and we will find a time that suits you.</p>
								<a class="svr-btn svr-btn--primary" href="tel:+919188572412">Call +91 91885 72412</a>
							</div>
							<div class="svr-ctaband__meta">
								<strong>Sampada VR Speciality Eye Care LLP</strong><br>
								Railway Station Bypass Road, Thazhepalam,<br>Tirur, Kerala 676101<br>
								Mon 9 AM&ndash;5 PM &middot; Tue 3 PM&ndash;5 PM &middot; Wed&ndash;Sat 9 AM&ndash;5 PM<br>
								<a href="/contact-us/">Directions and contact details &rarr;</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

			</main>
				<Footer />
</body>
</html>